                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a simple tower defense game, or rather, an inversion of that idea. You have to break through all the enemy towers. Overall, the game isn't bad, and it still holds up in 2026, but the final mission and the final BOSS tower are the biggest F*R%^ You I've ever seen, and I've been playing since the Atari 65XE.\r\n\r\nIn short, you die and repeat the mission until you know the entire map, where you can safely go without getting burned. Then you use that one 5-second window to deal damage, then circle the boss, and then another 5 seconds, and so on. This one boss takes me about an hour.",
